legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 23 m long."},{"id":"marker79","name":"Sherster Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 26 m long."},{"id":"marker80","name":"Northwark Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 37 m long."},{"id":"marker81","name":"Tolyntheri Ghoul","legend":"Whispers speak of a prime Ghoul who inhabits Tolyntheri hills and steals cattle at night."},{"id":"marker82","name":"Mepicapithe Banshee","legend":"Locals speak of a golden Banshee who inhabits Mepicapithe hills and terrorizes the region."},{"id":"marker83","name":"Yatanzvan Roc","legend":"Whispers speak of a great Roc who inhabits Yatanzvan hills and steals cattle at night."},{"id":"marker84","name":"Telon Banshee","legend":"Inscriptions speak of a prime Banshee who inhabits Telon hills and attacks anyone who dares to approach its lair."},{"id":"marker85","name":"Karinelathos Cyclops","legend":"Tipplers speak of a giant Cyclops who inhabits Karinelathos hills and harasses travelers in the area."},{"id":"marker86","name":"Irnazayim Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Way of Momaria."},{"id":"marker87","name":"Connodure Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Way of Momaria."},{"id":"marker88","name":"Pollum Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Way of Momaria."},{"id":"marker89","name":"Cocora Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Way of Momaria."},{"id":"marker90","name":"Lerurienek Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Celtic Spirits."},{"id":"marker91","name":"Abereskcal Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Way of Momaria."},{"id":"marker92","name":"Invelanver Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Way of Momaria."},{"id":"marker93","name":"Brinnserara Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Way of Momaria."},{"id":"marker94","name":"Cinatate Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Way of Momaria."},{"id":"marker95","name":"Hyesia Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Hellenic Beliefs."},{"id":"marker96","name":"Kousai Crows","legend":"A gang of mounted brigands."},{"id":"marker97","name":"Amanfico Rooks","legend":"A gang of mounted brigands."},{"id":"marker98","name":"Esteabusko Dogs","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker99","name":"Lerutuguto Boars","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker100","name":"Henessos Hares","legend":"A gang of mounted bandits."},{"id":"marker101","name":"Zitia Rats","legend":"A gang of forest robbers."},{"id":"marker102","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker103","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker104","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker105","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker106","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker107","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker108","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker109","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker110","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker111","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker112","name":"Phodozozory Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳤⲶⳢⲼⳢ ⳜⲾⳫⳎⳔⲾⲺⳃⳚⲼⳫⲴⳌⳎⳈⲾⳚ⳩ⲶⳲ⳩ⳎⳈⳬⳲ⳹ⳠⳚⲾⲶⲺⲴⳖⳀⳐⳐⳂⳜⳌⳎⲸⳈⳈ </div>"},{"id":"marker113","name":"Loureburi Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳝ ⳂⲴⲴⳎⳞⳆⳀⳊ⳩ⳠⲾⳐⳚⳫⳬ⳧ⳀⳔⳄⳲⳲⳊⳢ⳩ ⳘⳈⳆⲲⳜⲲⲺⳲ ⳈⳌⳔⳒⳞⳄⳜⳁⳬⳈⳂⳃⳜ ⳎⳁⳭⲸ ⳒⳈⳎ</div>"},{"id":"marker114","name":"Kaumaki Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠭᢑᢂᡑᠳᠡᡓᢂᡏᡠᡰᡡᡏᡝᡙᡏᡝᡁ᠀ᡒᢏ᠒᠀ᢡᢞᠯᢡᠨᠨᢜᡝᠽ᠀ᡙᡮᢠᢓ᠒ᡠᡔᡁᠽᡍᠿᡑ᠒ᡏᡴᡓᡟᢛᢠᢢᡡᡗᠰᡞᢥᠱᡒ᠑ᠡᡆᢀᡙᢂᠽᠿᠦᢁᢛᡔᠳᢑᢤᢟᢋᡭᢁᡖᠻᡍᡲᢑᡠᡠᡳᡆᡱᡗᢥᡠᢛᠨᡲᢟᢒᡀ᠒</div>"},{"id":"marker115","name":"Odonia Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡭᠿᡒᠡᢠᢏᢒᢢᠮᢂᡗᡒᠰᢋᡙᠿᡕ᠑ᢓᠿᡗᡔᠨᡀ᠒ᡭᡓᢏᠩᡁᡜᢞᡐᠭᠵᡒᡔᡏᢓᢛᢀᡞᡑᡡᢐᡒᢂᠦᢥᢟᢏᢏᠮᠨ᠐ᢞᠭᠡᠮᡜᡀᠾᡎᡗ᠐ᠲᡴᡔᢑᢋ</div>"},{"id":"marker116","name":"Lelius Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፀበዘተዘሐጰ  ለሰወደዘሐለረፐረወነሰከአ ሐነዘበነከጰአረአፈለፐሠገተቀሰ ደገደጰገሰየከወዘሠቀገሀነመደሠሰ ፈዘፀከ ፀረ  መ ከዘሐየየጸበፀፈተዐዘፐዐ ነየአፀቀጸፐዐፈ</div>"},{"id":"marker117","name":"Candumno Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ነጸፐሠጰዘ ነ ሠአፀ ኀፈሠጰአገጠወዘጰአረረረረቀገደየመሰተፀኀየሐተየፈየሰ </div>"},{"id":"marker118","name":"Llan Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ጸለ  መፀተወበከሠመገገረከቀወቀከቀ ፀሰከፈፈጸቀአመጰነ ጸዘሰ ረጸነደወፀነአሀ ፀጠሰሰሀፈ የ</div>"},{"id":"marker119","name":"Tuurila Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">መገአየጰጰፀረፐሰፀ ነረፐጰ አአዐአ አ  ሐጠረገሀበደፈመጰበሐሀከፈፀረበዘፐወደ ዘ ከወ ቀ በዐሰገ ጠፐጸወፐፐዘረኀፐጰከሀሐ ሐዘ</div>"},{"id":"marker120","name":"Durinaquen Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802𐠕𐠥\udc26\ud802𐠵\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠜\udc0a\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠫\udc08\ud802𐠔\ud802\ud802𐠅\udc35𐠬\udc19\udc13\udc14𐠯𐠔\ud802𐠭\ud802\ud802𐠠\ud802 \udc04\udc27𐠌\udc22\udc35\udc26𐠩𐠯\udc2f\udc10𐠯\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker121","name":"Sigentium Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༫༕༿༓༦༌༴༩༡༭༤༊༽༑༸༉༈༱༬༐༼༴༔༱༻༖༪༛༕༲་་༫༌༣༾༛༜༳༫༬༌༖༪༫༾༺་༬༬༑༾༜༵༔༳༇༑༔༵༵༫༛༬༶༂༗༯༈༈༢༑༆༜༑༗༈༚༕༣༌༨</div>"},{"id":"marker122","name":"Atimiloma Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༰༬༱༩༚༹༚༄༳༿༴༵༢༠༼༭༁༐ༀ༡༙༇༴༯༺༔༔༶༑༆ༀ༳༺༧༉༗༣༔༾༥༠་༦༨༷༺༚༽༨༇༴༓༹༕༚༢༆༥༘༬༜༬༅༒༴༫༱༶༑༣༈༆༴༡༤༁༯</div>"},{"id":"marker123","name":"Lactoriora Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢞ᠐ᠲᠵᡁᡓᢥᢋᠮᡀᠪᡡᡡᡆᡖᢦᠰᡑᢢᡎᡆᡰᡀᢤᢀᢛᡖᡲᡏᡳᡖᠰᡗᡭᡯᡜᡱᡒᡐᡱᠠᠰᠽᡟᡀᢋᠮᡖᡐᠿᡮᠭ</div>"},{"id":"marker124","name":"Semvarves Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠠𐠥\ud802\ud802𐠖𐠞𐠗𐠒𐠐\udc14 \udc23𐠚\udc03\udc1f\ud802𐠦\udc05\ud802\ud802𐠬\ud802\ud802𐠕𐠗\udc2d𐠰𐠈\ud802𐠷\ud802 \ud802𐠚\udc35\udc35\ud802𐠯\udc30\udc28</div>"},{"id":"marker125","name":"Rakzibdin Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡖᠳᠯᠪᠧᠵᠨᢓᡔᠲᠿᠦᡓᢁᡲᠱ᠀ᢋᡁᢠ᠐ᢛ᠐ᡕᡴᢋᡭᡐᡞᠻᢀᢤᡏᡁ᠑ᡗᠽᠽᡙᢓᠾᢟᡖᡑᠯᡒᠵᠮ᠒ᡀᢏᠩᢦᠧᡏᠩᡡᠿᠧᠻᡆᠳᢜ</div>"},{"id":"marker126","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker127","name":"Ruined Fortification","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker128","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":